  m_Name: 2DivingSuitOn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  lines:
  - DIVING SUIT FITTED ENGAGING RIG
  - ERROR
  - VISUAL APPARATUS FAULTY
  - ENGAGING SONAR //SPEAKER // MECHANISM
  - "User, your deepsea optics are damaged and do not meet safe use standards, I
    will engage your diving suit\u2019s sonar//speaker device."
  - Do not be alarmed, periodic abrasive sounds may emanate from your person.
  - This will ensure emergency servicemen can locate you from great distances.
  - "Refrain from standing near others as it may damage their hearing.\u201D "
  - User Listen Closely
  - "The Facility\u2019s integrity has depleted substantially, an SOS signal has
    been delivered, if no help arrives within\u2026"
  - "10 MINUTES\u2026"
  - Please evacuate to the nearest airlock
  - Any further idling may result in serious injury from imminent total facility
    collapse
  - BULKHEAD LOCK DISENGAGED
